  "summary": "Malicious code in aliftech-ui (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook (postinstall.js) runs on install and exfiltrates host metadata: it reads the machine hostname and the current OS username and sends them to the attacker-controlled endpoint hxxps://webhook[.]site/539f8bb9-497a-4104-92f7-f95a77204cc2/\u003chostname\u003e/\u003cusername\u003e via an HTTPS GET. The package is a minimal 526-byte file with no legitimate functionality beyond this beacon.",
